Package: sdf
Title: An Extensible Spatial Data Frame
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Josiah", "Parry", , "josiah.parry@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9910-865X"))
Description: A spatial data frame that is agnostic to the geometry
    representation it holds. A geometry vector becomes usable by
    implementing a small set of generics, in the manner of a trait, after
    which the spatial data frame, its 'dplyr' methods, and the spatial
    join and filter work unchanged. Implementations for the 'sf', 'geos',
    and 's2' packages are included.
